============================================================================================
STEP 2  the addition: a bank of lossless tuned absorbers
============================================================================================
  d_i'' + w_i^2 d_i = -b_i^T q'',      f_a = SUM_i b_i k_i d_i,   k_i = m_i w_i^2
  zeta = 0 is FORCED: a dissipative element can never be orthogonal to the damping
  family (that condition is a positive quadratic form, with no boundary term and no
  symmetry escape). d_i is independent of m_i, so f_a is LINEAR in the masses.
  resonances below the band: [20.0, 40.0, 70.0, 100.0, 125.0] Hz
  resonances above the band: [255.0, 300.0, 380.0, 520.0, 800.0] Hz
